# GUI04 run C -- the menu guard: `if (gl_mowner == ctl_pd) return;`
# (references/emutos/aes/geminput.c:400-402).
#
# Same C:\ text-view window as run B, but the File drop-down is opened first
# (hovering the title hands the mouse to the Control Manager) and the pointer
# is then moved back down over the window, where the drop-down stays open
# (OUTSIDE_STATE, A73). Six wheel-down detents there must change NOTHING:
# the Control Manager owns the mouse, so wheel_change returns before it looks
# for a window.
100  parkbr
400  move 600 240
900  mark A_DESKTOP
1200 move 38 35
1600 down
1603 up
1615 down
1618 up
2400 move 320 300
3200 mark B_WINOPEN
3600 move 88 240
3800 move 88 9
4400 mark C_MENUOPEN
4600 move 320 300
5000 wheel -1
5100 wheel -1
5200 wheel -1
5300 wheel -1
5400 wheel -1
5500 wheel -1
6200 mark D_MENUWHEEL
